# Local deploy targets (example — placeholders only)

**Do not commit real values.** Copy this file for notes, or use gitignored `.env.deploy.local` at the repo root (preferred for `scripts/deploy-vps.sh`).

```bash
cp docs/DEPLOY.local.md.example docs/DEPLOY.local.md   # optional notes
# create .env.deploy.local manually (gitignored) with your real values
```

## `.env.deploy.local` (gitignored)

```bash
DEPLOY_USER=your-deploy-user
DEPLOY_HOST=your-host.tailXXXX.ts.net
DEPLOY_PORT=45022
SSH_PRIV_KEY=~/.ssh/your-deploy-key
# Windows + PuTTY (optional; used when plink is on PATH):
SSH_PPK=~/.ssh/your-key.ppk
```

## One-shot from shell (same variable names)

```bash
export DEPLOY_USER=your-deploy-user
export DEPLOY_HOST=your-host.tailXXXX.ts.net
export DEPLOY_PORT=45022
export SSH_PRIV_KEY=~/.ssh/your-deploy-key
./scripts/deploy-vps.sh
```

Public runbook: [DEPLOY-WAVE.md](./DEPLOY-WAVE.md) uses generic placeholders only.